<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 261-7 V TRANSVAAL INVITATION XI.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 261-7 V TRANSVAAL INVITATION XI.</headline>
<dateline>SOWETO 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia scored 261-7 in their 45 overs against a Transvaal Invitation XI at the Elkah Stadium on Tuesday.</p>
